B.aNc=s(["Secure an employment offer from an SMC-approved healthcare institution first","Confirm your medical qualification is on SMC's recognised list","Upload documents to EPIC for primary source verification","Submit your registration application to the SMC","Begin under Conditional Registration \u2014 supervised practice for at least 2 years"],t.s)
