B.b_O=new A.bZ(!0,"AHPRA","Australian Health Practitioner Regulation Agency","National registration required to practise. Nursing and midwifery applicants are also assessed by ANMAC for migration purposes \u2014 ANMAC is a migration document, not a clinical registration.",!0,!0,"Confirmed against ahpra.gov.au and anmac.org.au, Jul 2026.",null,null)
